CompileTimeError: d139_a_chain_of_equals_is_refused.jern:3:17, line 3 column 17
 3 |     println(($a == true == true) as String)
   |                 ^^
 what: `==` can't be part of a chain of comparisons; group with `( )`
 why:  comparisons chain only when they all point the same way, and `==` and `!=` never chain (D139, standard 4.1)
